      "id": "cross-version-wire-fixture-compat",
      "title": "跨版本 Wire 夹具路径兼容",
      "goal": "历史 checkout 路径唯一迁移且 fork 默认版本符合上游同步快照，显式较新版本仍可验证",
      "journal": "docs/issue/跨版本Wire夹具兼容/journal.md",
      "policyId": "cross-version-wire-fixture-compat",
      "ownedPaths": [
        "config/scripts/cross-version-wire-fixture-compat/**",
